{"v": 3, "hash": "c4cbb87f96ff0139", "archived_at": "2026-11-01T00:06:13.587697+00:00", "pub": "2026-11-01T08:00:00+09:00", "url": "http://www.newsroad.co.kr/news/articleView.html?idxno=66836", "domain": "newsroad.co.kr", "feed": "정책", "publisher": "뉴스로드", "site_name": "뉴스로드", "resolved_url": "", "source_type": "general_media", "evidence_role": "independent", "source_tier": 3, "title": "최태원·샘 올트먼, 서울서 오찬 회동…\"스타게이트 동맹\" 재점검 나섰...", "title_kr": "최태원 SK 회장-샘 올트먼 오픈AI CEO, 서울서 AI 협력 논의", "summary": "최태원 SK그룹 회장과 샘 올트먼 오픈AI CEO가 서울에서 오찬 회동을 갖고 AI 인프라 협력 방안을 논의했다.", "detail": "", "implication": "", "why_important": "", "why_short": "", "open_question": "", "open_question_source": "unknown", "open_question_reject": "", "importance": "noise", "section": "international", "scope": "overseas", "category": "시장", "tags": ["#SK", "#오픈AI", "#AI인프라"], "topics": ["datacenter_ai"], "countries": ["KR", "US"], "article_type": "news", "features": {"event_type": "corporate_move", "korea_relevance": 2, "market_materiality": 1, "policy_materiality": 0, "novelty": 0, "evidence_strength": 0, "report_worthiness": 0}, "curation_status": "reviewed", "verified_evidence": {"version": 2, "article_hash": "c4cbb87f96ff0139", "source_components": {"article_hash": "c4cbb87f96ff0139", "title": "0cce1f65e8173ecab25f34a83e5a357c890c5cc54d513a47cfed4d2727801315", "source_excerpt": "87bc549495a88c407cea2b5702c390e34e40bee828d629fcb29db76e05113af0", "published_at": "be5973744bdb62b53a5c73ba63c465b2636dea9ea211a4027d72d70c09f0e158"}, "source_fingerprint": "b89934c5f8e6a68dac2d2437d97e4acb4474b0f1a4240d69ac228b5b8bf94a6f", "entities": [], "countries": ["KR"], "topics": [], "stages": [], "claims": ["31일"], "quantities": {"일": ["31"]}, "quantity_rules": 3, "manifest_fingerprint": "179c83ec39b6992ef25aa05ad51fee6c95a147c338779d92e0abf0d13dad0a58"}, "verified_source_components": {"article_hash": "c4cbb87f96ff0139", "title": "0cce1f65e8173ecab25f34a83e5a357c890c5cc54d513a47cfed4d2727801315", "source_excerpt": "87